,{},"['value' => '99.99', 'currency' => 'EUR']",". The ",[330,1291,1292],{},"currency"," must match the subscription's currency. Provide ",[330,1295,1219],{}," alone to change the price in place, or combine it with ",[330,1298,383],{}," to switch plans at a custom price (overriding the new plan's default).",[309,1301,1302,1307,1311],{},[327,1303,1304],{},[330,1305,1306],{},"prorate",[327,1308,1309],{},[330,1310,402],{},[327,1312,1313,1314,1317,1318,1320,1321,1324,1325,1330,1331,1334,1335,1337,1338,362],{},"How an immediate change is priced (default ",[330,1315,1316],{},"true","). ",[330,1319,1316],{}," charges the new price for the time left on the cycle, minus a credit for the old price over that same time. ",[330,1322,1323],{},"false"," charges the full new price for the current cycle on top of what was already paid. ",[1210,1326,1327,1329],{},[330,1328,1323],{}," does not skip the charge:"," use ",[330,1332,1333],{},"prorationCharge"," for that. Ignored when ",[330,1336,1333],{}," is ",[330,1339,1323],{},[309,1341,1342,1346,1350],{},[327,1343,1344],{},[330,1345,1333],{},[327,1347,1348],{},[330,1349,402],{},[327,1351,1352,1353,1355,1356,1358,1359,496,1362,496,1365,496,1368,1370,1371,1373,1374,362],{},"Whether an immediate change is charged at all (default ",[330,1354,1316],{},"). With ",[330,1357,1323],{},", the change applies now and nothing is charged for it: a downgrade gets no credit. The next renewal bills the new price, unless a change is already scheduled for that renewal: that change still applies. During a trial, the trial keeps running and its end bills the new plan. Sending ",[330,1360,1361],{},"invoiceImmediately: true",[330,1363,1364],{},"anchor",[330,1366,1367],{},"resetAnchor",[330,1369,663],{}," or a plan with a different interval with ",[330,1372,1323],{}," returns ",[330,1375,1376],{},"422",[309,1378,1379,1384,1388],{},[327,1380,1381],{},[330,1382,1383],{},"applyImmediately",[327,1385,1386],{},[330,1387,402],{},[327,1389,1390,1391,1393,1394,1396],{},"Apply the change now (",[330,1392,1316],{},") or at the end of the current period (",[330,1395,1323],{},", default).",[309,1398,1399,1404,1408],{},[327,1400,1401],{},[330,1402,1403],{},"invoiceImmediately",[327,1405,1406],{},[330,1407,402],{},[327,1409,1410,1411,1413,1414,1416,1417,1419,1420,1422,1423,1429],{},"Generate and charge a proration invoice immediately. Only applies when ",[330,1412,1383],{}," and ",[330,1415,1306],{}," are both ",[330,1418,1316],{},". Defaults to ",[330,1421,1323],{},", which parks the proration delta on the current cycle and bills it as a line on the next renewal invoice (and waives it if the subscription is cancelled first). ",[1210,1424,1425,1426,1428],{},"Set this to ",[330,1427,1316],{}," on yearly and other long-interval plans",", where the deferral to the next renewal costs you the most.",[309,1431,1432,1436,1440],{},[327,1433,1434],{},[330,1435,1364],{},[327,1437,1438],{},[330,1439,551],{},[327,1441,1442,1443,1446,1447,362],{},"Set the billing anchor to a specific date (",[330,1444,1445],{},"YYYY-MM-DD",", UTC). Cannot be combined with ",[330,1448,1367],{},[309,1450,1451,1455,1459],{},[327,1452,1453],{},[330,1454,1367],{},[327,1456,1457],{},[330,1458,402],{},[327,1460,1461,1462,362],{},"Reset the billing anchor to now. Cannot be combined with ",[330,1463,1364],{},[309,1465,1466,1470,1474],{},[327,1467,1468],{},[330,1469,663],{},[327,1471,1472],{},[330,1473,551],{},[327,1475,1476,1477,362],{},"Extend or set a trial until this date (ISO 8601). Cannot be combined with ",[330,1478,1364],{},[784,1480,1482],{"className":786,"code":1481,"language":788,"meta":789,"style":789},"\u002F\u002F Change the quantity (new total) and pass a custom idempotency key.\n$subscription = $vatly->subscriptions->update('subscription_123', [\n    'quantity' => 2,\n], [\n    'idempotencyKey' => 'subscription-update-123',\n]);\n\n\u002F\u002F Switch plan at a custom price (currency must match the subscription).\n$subscription = $vatly->subscriptions->upd